@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade Quality - Backend Testing Strategy Flow

start
:GitHub Actions or local developer runs\nmvn -B clean verify;
:Compile backend;
:Run JUnit test suite;
fork
  :Domain tests\nTradeOrder, WalletAccount,\nPosition, Market models;
fork again
  :Application service tests\nTrading, Wallet, Portfolio,\nMarket, User, Auth, Notifications;
fork again
  :Controller and security tests\nAuth/User/Market/Wallet/Portfolio,\nTrading security, JWT filters;
fork again
  :Integration/architecture tests\nMarketCachingIntegrationTest,\nModulithStructureTest;
end fork
if (All tests pass?) then (yes)
  :Verify succeeds;
else (no)
  :CI fails and blocks technical confidence;
endif
stop

note right
Evidence: backend/src/test/java and ../.github/workflows/maven.yml.
No frontend unit/e2e test files were found.
end note

@enduml
